   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the workers' compensation law, in relation to the direct\ndeposit of benefits; and amending a chapter of the laws of 2020 amending the\nworkers' compensation law relating to the direct deposit of benefits, as\nproposed in legislative bills numbers S.7210 and A.7579, in relation to the\neffectiveness thereof",
